The font files here are small subsets used only as fuzzing input; they are not in the AurOS image.
They keep their makers' licenses:
- dejavu-sans.ttf: DejaVu fonts, copyright Bitstream, Inc. (Bitstream Vera license) with public-domain
  changes: see the DejaVu section of docs/legal/licenses/component-copyrights.txt.
- liberation-sans.ttf: Liberation fonts, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (docs/legal/licenses has the text
  in website/assets/fonts/OFL.txt's form).
- freesans.ttf: GNU FreeFont, GNU GPL version 3 or later with the font exception.
- inter.otf, inter-bold.otf: Inter, SIL Open Font License 1.1, copyright The Inter Project Authors.
